    "description": "The SmartSecure Locker System is an IoT-based solution for secure storage in shared spaces like universities, gyms, and offices. It features real-time locker availability, biometric access, and alternative location suggestions when lockers are full. Users can manage lockers via a mobile app, ensuring convenience and security.",
